                    <p>Actuarial valuation mandatory for companies with 10+ employees (gratuity under Payment of Gratuity Act 1972). PUCM method per Ind AS 19/AS 15. Social Security Code 2020 (effective 21 Nov 2025): 50% CTC wage rule + 1-year fixed-term eligibility = 25-50% DBO increase, recognized as Past Service Cost in P&amp;L immediately. Patron coordinates: HR data &rarr; qualified actuary &rarr; report review &rarr; journal entries &rarr; audit integration. 5-7 day delivery. From Rs 8,000 per valuation.</p>
